Most of these problems are far more general issues in nethack that
demand far more general solutions than tweaking a single role.
Sporkhack makes valks harder by making monsters more buff, making good
armor easier to acquire, making two-handed weapons better than long
swords, and making Excalibur much, much harder to acquire, addessing
all your stated concerns. But those are general game choices that
affect many other classes.

If you want a harder, less monotonous combat wombat, and you're
already a multiple ascender, try another roguelike. For instance,
Crawl tackles class distinction and weapon skills very, very well, in
my opinion far more cogently than nethack does.


